            "review_title": "Review at Bento Bistro Saigon",
            "review_text": "Cynthia T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nSuperb cordon bleu in bento\nDec 2021 • Friends\nI lived the bento so much. The cordon bleu was very crispy and cheesy. It’s mushroom sauce was to die for. I chose sides as pasta and a very yum lemon tart. I need to come back here again and again! ❤️\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 9, 2021",
